<title>UK: London gold slips further as Comex weakens.</title>
<headline>London gold slips further as Comex weakens.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Slips further after Comex loses $10 shortly after opening vs forecast $7-$8 down. Spot currently $314.80/$315.30 vs opening at $318.85/$319.35 and Friday close $324.25/$324.75.</p>
<p>Heavy long liquidations, short selling. Next support $310.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Lower with gold at $4.38/$4.40. Support at $4.30.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - $405.50/$410.50 vs $419.00/$423.00 close.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - $177.00/$182.00 down $13.00.</p>
</text>
